Package: linux-gemini-dtcheck
Architecture: arm64
Description: MT6797 Gemini DT binding/dtbs schema check (builds no kernel)
 Runs the kernel dt_binding_check on the MT6797 bindings this series touches
 and CHECK_DTBS on mt6797-gemini-pda.dtb. Produces an (essentially empty)
 package; the point is the build log and the pass/fail gate.
